 style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"基础用法\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"demo-column\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Tabs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{items}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          defaultValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"plan\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          onChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{setActive}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"采购计划分区\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">          data-testid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"tabs-basic-root\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> data-testid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"tabs-active-log\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>当前标签：{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">active</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()}&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  